# QDQC · Story Engine

## Experience spine

```
NFC/card → Opening → 相逢鹊渡 → 前世 → 今世 → 山高路远(双向奔赴)
→ 我们/Memories → Quiet Days → Letter → Future → ∞ / More Days
```

Routes may exist (`/card`, `/story`, `/letter`) but the default experience is one continuous world.

## Progress contract

Every chapter exposes `progress 0→1` driving:

- camera position / lookAt
- layer parallax
- object visibility / morph
- typography opacity / stagger
- music intensity / theme / ambience

## First vertical slice (ship quality before breadth)

1. NFC awaken + audio unlock  
2. Butterfly portal into world  
3. River crossing → Magpie → Bridge lamps  
4. Title: 相逢鹊渡 / 相守情长  

Do not open all chapters until this slice meets the cinematic bar.

## Depth layers

`sky → moon/mountains → water/bridge → characters/creatures → DOM text/UI`
